    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive, Fight, and Explore a Shifting Maze</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MazeBreaker is a survival, exploration, and action game set in a constantly changing maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, the maze takes on a new form. You'll need to explore, fight off threats, and build your own map to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unpredictable maze, find your own path and conquer it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival in the Maze</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/2e9303ca0a605376fa0c45052aab66d2.poster.avif?t=1754648151\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/2e9303ca0a605376fa0c45052aab66d2.webm?t=1754648151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/2e9303ca0a605376fa0c45052aab66d2.mp4?t=1754648151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maze is filled with hidden threats and dangerous creatures. Gather resources and hunt to secure what you need to survive. As night falls, the danger grows. Find shelter and stay out of sight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Hidden Special Zones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/f47666635e28598b7441f0f2afe2fafe.avif?t=1754648151\" data-has-big width=800 height=578 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/2f57ebbb91813045e50d40743d5f4c5e.avif?t=1754648151\" data-has-big width=800 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maze is more than just finding the right path. Scattered throughout are <strong>special zones</strong> filled with rare resources and useful objects\u2014but beware, powerful monsters and deadly traps await!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unravel the Secrets of the Maze Sectors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/68a11fcba5797b5135924cb2dd4135fe.avif?t=1754648151\" data-has-big width=800 height=442 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within the maze lie hidden sectors, each containing pieces of the maze\u2019s ultimate truth. Uncover its secrets and <strong>decide how you will act</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Night Changes Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/1c4c782471034f13853cf645886cecae.poster.avif?t=1754648151\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/1c4c782471034f13853cf645886cecae.webm?t=1754648151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/1c4c782471034f13853cf645886cecae.mp4?t=1754648151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While daylight offers relative safety, <strong>nightfall transforms the maze</strong>, introducing new monsters and traps. Before the <strong>safe zone at the maze\u2019s center closes</strong>, make sure to return in time! The ticking clock adds to the tension, making every expedition a thrilling challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Carve Your Own Path with Star Fragments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/2a4fc0b17dbfc78f75f8efffd1131182.poster.avif?t=1754648151\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/2a4fc0b17dbfc78f75f8efffd1131182.webm?t=1754648151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/2a4fc0b17dbfc78f75f8efffd1131182.mp4?t=1754648151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By collecting star fragments during your journey, you can create permanent paths through the maze and dash across them at high speed. Use them strategically to build your own map.\u00a0 \u00a0 But be careful. Mysterious pursuers may follow the trails you leave behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Wall Manipulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/fd9af315f4ec050df71a36dd1b14cacc.poster.avif?t=1754648151\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/fd9af315f4ec050df71a36dd1b14cacc.webm?t=1754648151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/fd9af315f4ec050df71a36dd1b14cacc.mp4?t=1754648151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather energy during your journey to <strong>manipulate the maze walls</strong> to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Open new paths</strong> to access unexplored areas<br>\u2714 <strong>Climb higher ground</strong> to scout ahead and gain a tactical advantage<br>\u2714 <strong>Use walls in combat</strong>\u2014crush enemies or block their approach</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, strategize, and survive the ever-changing labyrinth!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive, Fight, and Explore a Shifting Maze</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MazeBreaker is a survival, exploration, and action game set in a constantly changing maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, the maze takes on a new form. You'll need to explore, fight off threats, and build your own map to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unpredictable maze, find your own path and conquer it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival in the Maze</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/2e9303ca0a605376fa0c45052aab66d2.poster.avif?t=1754648151\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/2e9303ca0a605376fa0c45052aab66d2.webm?t=1754648151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/2e9303ca0a605376fa0c45052aab66d2.mp4?t=1754648151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maze is filled with hidden threats and dangerous creatures. Gather resources and hunt to secure what you need to survive. As night falls, the danger grows. Find shelter and stay out of sight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Hidden Special Zones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/f47666635e28598b7441f0f2afe2fafe.avif?t=1754648151\" data-has-big width=800 height=578 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/2f57ebbb91813045e50d40743d5f4c5e.avif?t=175464815