" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/2a4fc0b17dbfc78f75f8efffd1131182.poster.avif?t=1754648151\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/2a4fc0b17dbfc78f75f8efffd1131182.webm?t=1754648151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/2a4fc0b17dbfc78f75f8efffd1131182.mp4?t=1754648151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By collecting star fragments during your journey, you can create permanent paths through the maze and dash across them at high speed. Use them strategically to build your own map.\u00a0 \u00a0 But be careful. Mysterious pursuers may follow the trails you leave behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Wall Manipulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/fd9af315f4ec050df71a36dd1b14cacc.poster.avif?t=1754648151\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/fd9af315f4ec050df71a36dd1b14cacc.webm?t=1754648151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617130/extras/fd9af315f4ec050df71a36dd1b14cacc.mp4?t=1754648151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather energy during your journey to <strong>manipulate the maze walls</strong> to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Open new paths</strong> to access unexplored areas<br>\u2714 <strong>Climb higher ground</strong> to scout ahead and gain a tactical advantage<br>\u2714 <strong>Use walls in combat</strong>\u2014crush enemies or block their approach</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, strategize, and survive the ever-changing labyrinth!</p>",
